{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Woq1ne5QKg1794919641.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中央軍委副主席張升民在《人民日報》撰文，要求推進軍隊反腐敗鬥爭，全面提高跨軍隊和地方的治理水平。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MILITARY-2000-1_CLEAN_20261117_201411.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RIbZQU4D071794919662.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>文章提到要深入推進軍隊反腐敗鬥爭，堅決掃除一切影響人民軍隊的，消極腐敗現象，堅決清除危害國防安全，國家安全的重大隱患，深化軍隊和地方反腐敗協作聯動，不斷提升防治腐敗整體合力。聚焦在重大裝備研製，重大工程建設，軍隊及地方交往活動等，重點加強監督檢查，全面提高治理水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T13:14:36.285869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T11:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T22:35:08.436042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T13:07:43.429883+00:00","content_hash":"1a0f8425d7db71a607dcadcf685291f67f5a560d8df99811c1276ecbd367d30b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T13:14:36.285869+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}